    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "True or False? $\\dfrac{4^{2x}}{4^2}=4^x$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "False.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{4^{2x}}{4^2}&=4^{2x-2}.\\end{align*}$$This equals $4^x$ only when $2x-2=x$, so $x=2$. The statement is not an identity.",
